# AICL Example: Quicksort Partition
# AX sub-language — compiles to real code.

Goal:
Lomuto partition

Layer:
Core

Behavior Partition
    Input: array, low, high
    Output: pivot_index
    Action:
        pivot = array[high]
        i = low - 1
        for j in range(low, high):
            if array[j] < pivot:
                i = i + 1
                array[i], array[j] = array[j], array[i]
        array[i + 1], array[high] = array[high], array[i + 1]
        return i + 1
